{{also|anatomie}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|LL.|de}} {{m|en|anatomia}}, from {{etyl|grc|de}} {{m|grc|ἀνατομία}}, from {{m|grc|ἀνατομή||dissection}}, from {{m|grc|ἀνά||up}} + {{m|grc|τέμνω||I cut, incise}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ʔanatoˈmiː/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-Anatomie.ogg|Audio|lang=de}}
* {{rhymes|iː|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|f|Anatomie|Anatomien}}

# {{lb|de|biology}} [[anatomy|Anatomy]], [[study]] of the [[structure]] of [[living]] [[being]]s.
# {{lb|de|biology}} [[dissection|Dissection]].
# {{lb|de|biology}} [[structural|Structural]] [[makeup]] of an [[organism]] or parts thereof.
# [[anatomy department|Anatomy department]], [[anatomical institute]].
# [[treatise|Treatise]] on the [[science]] of [[anatomy]].

